Jeene Bhi De Duniya Humein Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Hindi television serial name Dil Sambhal Ja Zara sung by Yasser Desai.

Strumming Pattern: D [chuck]DD [chuck]

Jee [Am]ne bhi de duniya hume,

il [F]zaam na la [Am]ga,

ek [Am]baar toh karte hai sab,

ko [F]i haseen kha [Am]ta,

war [E]na koi kai [F]se bhala,

cha [E]he kisiko [F]bepanah,

Aey [C]zindagi tu [G]hi bata,

kyu [F]ishq hai gu [E]naah

